&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;React 19 + TypeScript + Vite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS Amplify Gen 2 (AppSync/GraphQL, DynamoDB, Lambda, Cognito)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TanStack React Query 5 for caching and optimistic updates&lt;/li&gt;
